  "evidence": [
    "The preceding48function parallel easy pass found two nonoriginal upper ability guards in draw_special and cached abil_index observations in suggest_abil. Complete-pin independent review confirms only the negative sentinel guard is original, and calls abil_index for preq, again for abil_cond after the owner field reads, and per matching bonus row. Corrected literal proposals preserve all other effects and historical identities/claims.",
    "Admit the DesignWin/SelectPartWin owner TU closure and original identities for conservative codegen/metadata impact review. Only the three screened full bodies are initially proposed for publication; preserve other source and expand evidence before any dependent change. No flags, layouts, exports, copied instructions or safety fixes.",
    "One simplest fixed candidate per function in the current context; at most three bounded attempts when genuinely new pin/type/caller evidence justifies them. Use native body/signature guards and unchanged complete physical production-object control, one isolated worktree and compiler lease. Compare full TU/strict identity effects and native outside-selected residuals; preserve FAIL/UNKNOWN.",
    "Fresh application build/link, source/claim/mapping/reference continuity, relevant actual-source host controls and independent source/artifact review precede authorized manual integration. Preserve matching/linked/structure/runtime obligations; no automatic or full-game acceptance."
  ],
  "intent": "Recover original DesignWin ability rendering and suggestion observations, preserving the original unchecked paths and natural owner calls.",
